<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},&nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.</p>

<p><br />
To request your eTicket, bags, seats, or carbon offset tax invoice&nbsp;or copy of a flight booking itinerary confirmation you can do so online.<br />
<br />
<strong>For booking itinerary confirmation.</strong><br />
<br />
After your ticket is issued, you'll receive an email confirming your booking, along with a tax invoice, usually within 24 hours. This email will be sent as a PDF attachment to the email address you provided during booking.</p>

<p><strong>For tax invoice or copy of your itinerary.</strong><br />
<br />
You can access&nbsp;your&nbsp;eticket itinerary receipt&nbsp;(tax invoice) or&nbsp;email a copy of your itinerary / confirmation email at any time via&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/manage-booking.html">Manage Booking</a>. Just&nbsp;select Resend tax invoice&nbsp;or Email Itinerary.</p>

<p>To request a&nbsp;copy of a tax invoice for&nbsp;up to seven years after purchase visit the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/manage-booking/tax-invoice.html">Tax invoice</a>&nbsp;page.&nbsp;A tax invoice is available for the following products, for bookings from Australia only:</p>

<ul>
	<li>eticket</li>
	<li>Bags</li>
	<li>Seats</li>
	<li>Carbon offset&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
If you require further assistance call us on Ph 13 13 13 within Australia or your local <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/support/contact-us.html">Qantas office</a>.</body>
</html>